<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 2.9730.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 2.9730.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 2.9730 against the dollar, down from 2.9650 on Wednesday, and at 1.8115 against the mark, down from 1.8085, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The zloty was fixed flat from Wednesday's 3.11 percent from the weighted central dollar and mark parity rates.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
